@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam classFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

actor "调用方" as Caller
participant "GameCore" as GC
participant "CardResolver" as CR

Caller -> GC: ① play_round(cards_1, cards_2, build_tgt, dismantle_tgt)
activate GC

GC -> GC: ② _validate()
note right: 检查游戏未结束、卡牌在手、\nBUILD的 build/dismantle互斥校验

GC -> GC: ③ 快照 BeforeResolve (HP, energy, statuses)

GC -> GC: ④ 为每个玩家的每张卡构建 Resolver 任务
note right: ctx传递 build_target + dismantle_target

GC -> CR: ⑤ CardResolver.resolve(tasks)
activate CR
CR --> GC: ResolutionResult(details)
deactivate CR

GC -> GC: ⑥ play_cards() — 移除手牌
GC -> GC: ⑦ discard_pile 追加

GC -> GC: ⑧ 记录 PlayerHistoryItem(card, build_target, dismantle_target)

GC -> GC: ⑨ AfterResolve 快照 + 检测游戏结束

alt game over (HP≤0)
  GC --> Caller: RoundResult (is_over=True)
else continue

  GC -> GC: ⑩ _tick_status_lifetimes()
  GC -> GC: ⑪ 检测 cycle end (round 3 结束?)

  alt cycle ended
    GC -> GC: bleed 扣血 + _start_cycle()
    GC -> GC: 检测 bleed 后是否游戏结束
  end

  GC -> GC: ⑫ round_number++, round_in_cycle++

  GC -> GC: ⑬ AfterEndActions 快照
  GC --> Caller: RoundResult

end

deactivate GC

@enduml
